30:T1279,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a private driver useful in AlUla?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, if you plan more than one or two stops. AlUla's sites are spread across the valley and on-demand taxis are limited, so a private driver keeps one car with you for the whole day, waits at each stop and carries your bags."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get from AlUla airport to my hotel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pre-book a private car from AlUla International Airport (ULH). It is about 30 km and ~30 min to the resort area. We track your flight, so a delay moves your pickup, and 15–30 minutes of waiting is free."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I arrange a private transfer before arriving?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — that is the usual way. Send your flight number, hotel and passenger count by form or WhatsApp. The fare is agreed before you book and you receive driver details before pickup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I visit several attractions in one day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Book a private driver by the hour or for the day, and list the places you want. Hegra, Dadan and Jabal Ikmah are visited through Experience AlUla experiences, so book those slots first and we plan the drive times around them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you take me to Hegra?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — to the Hegra Visitor Centre, where Experience AlUla tours meet. Book the tour with them; we arrange the car there and back, timed to your slot. We provide transport only, not the tour."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get home from a Maraya concert?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Agree a pickup time and point in advance. Because the audience leaves together, a pre-arranged car is much easier than finding one at closing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I travel from AlUla to another Saudi city?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Madinah is about 330 km, Riyadh about 1050 km and Jeddah about 700 km by road, each as one private car with a fixed fare agreed before booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I travel from Red Sea resorts to AlUla?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Red Sea International Airport and AlUla are separate destinations about 260 km apart by road (~4 hr 25 min). We arrange the private transfer from RSI, or from a Red Sea resort, to your AlUla hotel — and the reverse. Treat it as a planned leg of the trip."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Shura Island or AMAALA part of AlUla?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Shura Island and AMAALA are on the Red Sea coast and AlUla is inland; they are separate destinations. Travellers combine them, which is why a private inter-destination transfer helps."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a meet and greet at AlUla airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Meet & greet is provided at arrivals. Share your flight number when you book; we track the flight, so the driver is there when you land, and driver details reach you on WhatsApp before pickup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I travel from AlUla to NEOM or AMAALA?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. NEOM is about 400 km from AlUla by road (roughly 6 hours 45 minutes to the NEOM Bay Airport area) and AMAALA about 295 km as a planning estimate. Both are separate destinations, so we treat each as a planned private transfer with the fare agreed before booking. Some NEOM sites need access clearance, which you arrange in advance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I provide when requesting a quote?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pickup and drop-off, date and time, number of passengers and large bags, your flight number for airport trips, and the stops you want for a day with a driver. The vehicle category is chosen with you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can families travel with luggage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Tell us the number of large cases and the ages of children, and we choose a full-size SUV or a van so everyone travels together."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What payment options are available, and can companies get invoices?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cash to the driver or bank transfer, with an electronic receipt on request. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel or change a booking?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cancellation is free up to 24 hours before pickup, and changes to time or address can be made on WhatsApp."}}]}29:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$30"}}]
