 bags when you book — golf bags, photo gear and family cases included."},{"title":"Private ride","desc":"15–30 minutes of free waiting after landing. The ride to the resort area is about 30 km."},{"title":"Your hotel","desc":"Dropped at the hotel entrance. Ask us to add the next morning's pickup for Hegra or the Old Town."}],"departure":[{"title":"Book your return","desc":"Send your flight time and hotel."},{"title":"Pickup worked back","desc":"We set the pickup from your departure time, allowing for the drive to ULH."},{"title":"Hotel pickup","desc":"The driver meets you at the lobby and loads the bags."},{"title":"Drop at ULH","desc":"Straight to the terminal for your flight."}],"code":"ULH"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80","children":"We track your flight, so a late landing moves your pickup. Share the flight number and your hotel and the fare is agreed before you travel."}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://wa.me/966539388072?text=Salam!%20AlUla%20airport%20(ULH)%20arrival%20transfer.%0A%E2%80%A2%20Flight%20number%20%26%20arrival%20time%3A%20%0A%E2%80%A2%20To%20(hotel%20%2F%20resort)%3A%20%0A%E2%80%A2%20Date%3A%20%0A%E2%80%A2%20Passengers%20%26%20large%20bags%3A%20%0A%E2%80%A2%20Vehicle%20(Executive%20sedan%20%2F%20SUV%20%2F%20Van)%3A%20","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#FACC15] px-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0B1F14] hover:bg-[#FDE047] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white","children":"Plan My AlUla Airport Transfer"}]]}],"$L3a"]}]]}]
